# Northstar Home Services

A modern, responsive website concept for a home services business. It features a clean design, service information, and an interactive estimate calculator to help visitors explore potential service costs.

## Live Demo

[View Northstar Home Services](https://charlesolivar006.github.io/north-star-services/)

## Features

- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile devices
- Modern design with a clean color palette
- Home service cards with service selection
- Interactive estimate calculator with sample price ranges
- Frequently Asked Questions section
- Mobile navigation menu
- Contact form with basic client-side validation
- Scroll reveal animations
- Reduced-motion support

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Tailwind CSS via CDN
- Google Fonts

## Project Purpose

This project was created to practice front-end web development, responsive design, JavaScript interactions, and user interface design.

## Important Notes

- This is a portfolio demonstration project.
- Service prices and service-area information are illustrative examples, not verified business offerings.
- The estimate calculator provides sample estimates only.
- The contact form demonstrates client-side validation and does not currently send or store messages.
- Tailwind CSS and Google Fonts are loaded from external services, so an internet connection is needed for those resources.

## Run Locally

1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Keep `index.html`, `style.css`, and `script.js` in the same folder.
3. Open `index.html` in a web browser.

